# CR 733.1: a cast given up is reversed whole, its payments canceled, where nothing it did may not be reversed. Bolas's
# Citadel casts Bone Splinters off the top of the library for 1 life; with no effect replacing that life, the payment
# moved no card out of a hidden zone, so at the question of which creature to sacrifice the cast may still be cancelled:
# the life comes back, Bone Splinters goes back on top of the library (a card moved from the library to the stack, which
# may be reversed), and both creatures stay. Then Toxic Deluge is begun from the hand, a Swamp tapped for it - a mana ability
# that only taps - and given up in the mana window: the Swamp untaps and its {B} is gone from the pool.

